# Preserve native game payload bytes across platforms.
* -text
# DazedTL's glossary, settings, skills and assistant notes, and VX Ace's ace_json, stay out of players' downloads.
/.dazedtl export-ignore
/ace_json export-ignore
/[aA][gG][eE][nN][tT][sS].[mM][dD] export-ignore
# Images decoded from the game's archives reach players inside the archives.
/.dazedtl/len-method/work/img export-ignore dazedtl-decoded-images
